### CopyToFrontEnd — copy runtime-read collections from ChatHealthyDataPipelines → ChatHealthyFrontEnd
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "CopyToFrontEnd"
}

###

### MigrateFromLegacy — one-time copy of ZipCountyCrosswalk + providers_staging from LearnAI → ChatHealthyDataPipelines
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "MigrateFromLegacy"
}

###

### ScaleUp — pre-scale ChatHealthyDataPipelines to M30/M200 before heavy jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "ScaleUp",
    "payload": { "cluster": "ChatHealthyDataPipelines" }
}

###

### ScaleDown — scale ChatHealthyDataPipelines back to M10/M20 after jobs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "ScaleDown",
    "payload": { "cluster": "ChatHealthyDataPipelines" }
}

###

